mod.zoom.name = Zoom
mod.zoom.desc = Hold-to-zoom camera (OptiFine-style).

config.zoom.scale = Zoom strength
config.zoom.scale.desc = Field-of-view scale while the zoom key is held (lower = closer). 0.15 is about 4–5× at default FOV.
config.zoom.scroll = Scroll step
config.zoom.scroll.desc = How much each wheel notch changes zoom while the key is held (scroll up = zoom in).
config.zoom.smooth = Zoom smoothness
config.zoom.smooth.desc = How fast zoom eases in and out each frame.

